    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "A substantial  9- bedroom detached residence extending  to approximately  4360 sq ft. ideally located at Ballyhowly, Knock, Co. Mayo. This property enjoys  a prime location, within walking distance of Knock Shrine.  Knock village offers an excellent range of amenities including shops, hotels, museum, pubs and restaurants, together with a regular bus service.  The property is conveniently located approximately 10km from Claremorris, 20km from Ireland West Airport Knock, and 30km from Castlebar. Railway services are available from both Claremorris and Ballyhaunis, providing connections on the Dublin-Westport line. \r\n\r\nInternally, the residence offers exceptionally spacious and versatile accommodation. While presented in good condition throughout, the property would benefit from some modernisation and upgrading, providing an excellent opportunity for the new owner to enhance the accommodation to their own taste and requirements.\r\n\r\nSome of its features include large bright entrance hallway, gas-fired fireplace in the sitting room, fully fitted kitchen with Aga Range, tiled ensuites, carpeted bedrooms, double glazed windows, mahogony doors throughout, hollowcore flooring, oil-fired central heating.  Externally the property benefits from a tarmacadam driveway with ample off-street parking, and garage.\r\n\r\nThe accommodation includes Entrance Porch, Entrance Hallway, Sitting Room, Kitchen/Dining Room, 2 additional  Dining Rooms, Office, 9 Bedrooms, 11 Bathrooms and  Garage.\r\n\r\nThis property would make a superb family home or an excellent Bed and Breakfast Business .\r\n\r\nViewing is highly recommended to appreciate the scale, location and potential of this impressive property."
      },
