ator.\r\n\r\nBedroom 6 - 4.05m x 3.614m \r\nCarpeted flooring, 1 radiator.\r\n\r\nEnsuite - 2.135m x 0.695m \r\nFully tiled, wc., wash hand basin, pump shower, 1 radiator.\r\n\r\nMain Bathroom - 1.735m x 1.6m \r\nTiled flooring, walls semi-tiled, bath, wc., wash hand basin, coving to ceiling, 1 radiator.\r\n\r\nEmergency Exit - 3.191m x 0.938m \r\n\r\n\r\nExtension  - Rear of Property - \r\n\r\n\r\nHallway - 5.735m x 1.135m \r\nCarpeted flooring.\r\n\r\nKitchen/Living Room - 5.286m x 4.081m \r\nTimber flooring, vaulted ceiling, patio door to rear garden, 2 radiators.\r\n\r\nBedroom 1 - 4.33m x 3.36m \r\nCarpeted flooring, built in wardrobes, 1 radiator\r\n\r\nBathroom - 2.109m x 2.033m \r\nTiled flooring, walls semi-tiled, wc., wash hand basin, bath, 1 radiator.\r\n\r\nUtility Room - 3.34m x 2.716m \r\nPlumbed for washing machine and dryer, sink, linoleum flooring, fitted units.\r\n\r\nUpstairs - \r\n\r\n\r\nBedroom 2 - 4.764m x 3.01m \r\nCarpeted flooring, 1 radiator.\r\n\r\nBedroom 3 - 3.39m x 3.35m \r\nCarpeted flooring, 1 radiator.\r\n\r\nBathroom - 2.4m x 1.313m \r\nWc., wash hand basin, pump shower, timber panelling, 1 radiator.\r\n\r\nGarage - 4.2m x 3.771m \r\nThis incorporates the Boiler House.\r\n\r\n"
